      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "项是前面一项和随后一项的算术平均值时，这个数列才是等",
        "差数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "223",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "223. 下列有限数列是等差数列吗？",
        "а) $7,17,27,37$；　　б) $-17,-7,7,17,27$；",
        "в) $2,12,22,32$；　　г) $2,22,222$；",
        "д) $\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{3}{4},\\frac{5}{4},\\frac{7}{4}$；　　е) $\\frac{4}{3},\\frac{4}{5},\\frac{4}{7},\\frac{4}{9}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "224",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "224. 写出下列等差数列$(a_n)$的前5项，设：",
        "а) $a_1=10$，$d=4$；　　б) $a_1=29$，$d=-5$；",
        "в) $a_1=1.7$，$d=-0.2$；　　г) $a_1=-3\\frac{1}{2}$，$d=\\frac{5}{6}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "225",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "225. 求下列等差数列的公差与第6项，已知它们的前2项",
        "是：",
        "а) $70,100,\\cdots$；　　б) $240,190,\\cdots$；",
        "в) $-20,-5,\\cdots$；　　г) $\\frac{1}{3},1,\\cdots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "226",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "226. 在下面写出的等差数列$(b_n)$里，前2项是未知的，把它",
        "们求出来：",
        "а) $b_1,b_2,17,23,29,\\cdots$；",
        "б) $b_1,b_2,-19,-11.5,-4,\\cdots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "227",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "227. 设$(x_n)$是等差数列. 通过下面各题里的两项表示它的",
        "公差$d$：",
        "а) $x_{10}$与$x_{11}$，б) $x_6$与$x_8$，в) $x_{20}$与$x_{23}$，",
        "г) $x_{12}$与$x_{16}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "228",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "228. 已知等差数列$(c_n)$的两项：",
        "а) $c_6=16$和$c_8=22$，求$c_7,c_3,c_{10}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
